  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The writing system seems to focus on characters made from several detailed
    strokes in a vertical line, slightly resembling our own languages with Asian
    origins.

    The red drawing on the right almost feels like a warning or notice
    of some kind, and probably isn''t an actual word, but a symbol instead.


    Probably
    the most interesting thing in this mural is the squid-like drawings. I wonder
    if this could have been information of something like an underground aquarium?


    a


    a'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
